<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Drum Scribe — Audio to Drum Sheet Music for iOS</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0f172a;
      --surface: #1e293b;
      --text: #f8fafc;
      --muted: #94a3b8;
      --primary: #f97316;
      --primary-hover: #ea580c;
      --border: #334155;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    header {
      padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      max-width: 920px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .logo {
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.65rem;
    }

    .app-icon {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f97316, #ef4444);
      border-radius: 9px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    main {
      flex: 1;
      max-width: 920px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.15);
      color: #fb923c;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      border: 1px solid rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.3);
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2.75rem;
      line-height: 1.15;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .subtitle {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 620px;
      margin: 0 auto 2rem;
    }

    .btn-download {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.6rem;
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 1rem 2rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.1s;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .btn-download:hover {
      background: var(--primary-hover);
    }

    .btn-download:active {
      transform: scale(0.98);
    }

    .meta {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
    }

    .features {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.25rem;
      text-align: left;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--surface);
      padding: 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 14px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .card h3 {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .card p {
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .install-box {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 2rem;
      text-align: left;
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .install-box h2 {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .steps {
      list-style: none;
      counter-reset: step-counter;
    }

    .steps li {
      counter-increment: step-counter;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      padding-left: 2.3rem;
      position: relative;
      color: #cbd5e1;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .steps li:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .steps li::before {
      content: counter(step-counter);
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 0.1rem;
      width: 1.55rem;
      height: 1.55rem;
      background: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.2);
      color: #fb923c;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <div class="logo">
      <div class="app-icon">🥁</div>
      <span>Drum Scribe</span>
    </div>
    <span style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted);">iOS • v1.0 Beta</span>
  </header>

  <main>
    <span class="badge">Audio-to-Sheet-Music Transcription</span>
    <h1>Turn any drum track into playable sheet music.</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">
      Record live drums or import an audio file, and Drum Scribe automatically transcribes every groove, fill, and cymbal hit into clean drum notation on your iPhone.
    </p>

    <a href="DrumScribe.ipa" download class="btn-download">
      ⬇ Download DrumScribe.ipa (v1.0)
    </a>
    <div class="meta">Free Beta Build • iOS 16.0+ • Sideload required</div>

    <section class="features">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>🎙️ Instant Audio Transcription</h3>
        <p>Import audio files or record straight from your iPhone mic to generate accurate drum notation in seconds.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>🎼 Clean Drum Notation</h3>
        <p>Automatically separates kick, snare, hi-hat, toms, and cymbals into standard readable drum sheet music.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>🎧 Practice & Export</h3>
        <p>Follow along measure by measure, slow down tricky fills, and take your transcriptions to the practice room.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="install-box">
      <h2>How to install Drum Scribe on your iPhone</h2>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li>Download <strong>DrumScribe.ipa</strong> above onto your Mac or Windows PC.</li>
        <li>Open a free sideloading tool like <a href="https://sideloadly.io" target="_blank" style="color: #fb923c;">Sideloadly</a> or <a href="https://altstore.io" target="_blank" style="color: #fb923c;">AltStore</a> on your computer and connect your iPhone via USB.</li>
        <li>Drag <strong>DrumScribe.ipa</strong> into the tool, sign in with your Apple ID, and trust your developer profile under <strong>Settings → General → VPN & Device Management</strong> on your iPhone.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    &copy; 2026 Drum Scribe • Audio-to-Sheet-Music for iOS
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
